  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Gate Warden Lance",
    "summary": "As the [first battle round](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-battle-round) begins, pick 2 objectives as your foundations, and place a round foundation marker, 40mm across, in each.\n\nA unit counts as on your defensive line if a line drawn from any point of one foundation marker to any point of the other crosses the base of one of its models, or its hull if it has no base.\n\nWhile one of your **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS** units counts as on your defensive line, it gets this ability:\n\n**Against the Horde**: whenever one of this unit's models attacks a **visible** enemy unit, the attack can ignore some or all modifiers to its [Hit roll](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls), and weapons of this unit's models get **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.",
